          <type><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref>&lt; dim &gt; * const</type>
          <defname>eptr</defname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>computes F = (A_i vD . n_i) and its products with the upstream C0 on all facets, also computes FV flux balances </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes A_i vD . n_i for all facets and its product with the upstream concentrations. Stores &apos;facet flux&apos; and &apos;facet flux concentration&apos; product variables. Accumulates the flux balance and flux concentration balances in the corresponding node variables.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>vD can be used directly as interstitial velocity since the FV is scaled by porosity</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="attention"><para>the thickness of lower-dimensional elements is taken into account</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="attention"><para>, assumes that the FV variables &apos;flux balance&apos; and &apos;new concentration&apos; were zeroed out before.</para>
</simplesect>
@tested OK SKM 17/8/19 </para>
        </detaileddescription>
